Package: opamr
Type: Package
Title: Antibiotic Prescribing Data from 'OpenPrescribing' Linked to the 'AMR' Package
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Package", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieves English primary-care prescribing data (items, quantity and
    cost by month and by organisation) from the 'OpenPrescribing' API
    <https://openprescribing.net/api/>, and converts between antimicrobial names,
    'AMR' package antimicrobial codes, ATC codes and British National Formulary (BNF)
    chemical codes using a bundled crosswalk. Includes helpers for list-size and
    STAR-PU denominators, and publication-quality 'ggplot2' functions (colour-blind
    safe palette, direct labels, journal figure sizes) for prescribing time series,
    seasonality, between-organisation distributions and drug-by-month heatmaps.
